{"blocks":[["MIT/Conference/IIA/25/04/15/","source-block-35897","This is critical because AI infrastructure at scale requires massive energy. That’s why there’s a convergence happening between energy policy and AI infrastructure.",["Person/Chase Lochmiller Chase Lochmiller | LinkedIn","AI Notes","1 -"]],["MIT/Conference/IIA/25/04/15/","source-block-36075","It’s also why the Secretary of Energy was nearly on this panel — the DOE is deeply interested in this space now, because:",["Person/Chase Lochmiller Chase Lochmiller | LinkedIn","AI Notes","1 -"]],["MIT/Conference/IIA/25/04/15/","source-block-36210","Energy is one of the primary bottlenecks for scaling AI.",["Person/Chase Lochmiller Chase Lochmiller | LinkedIn","AI Notes","1 -"]],["MIT/Conference/IIA/25/04/15/","source-block-36276","⸻",["Person/Chase Lochmiller Chase Lochmiller | LinkedIn","AI Notes","1 -"]],["MIT/Conference/IIA/25/04/15/","source-block-36289","On Customers and Demand",["Person/Chase Lochmiller Chase Lochmiller | LinkedIn","AI Notes","1 -"]],["MIT/Conference/IIA/25/04/15/","source-block-36322","Yes — we do have customers. In fact, we have many, both large and small.",["Person/Chase Lochmiller Chase Lochmiller | LinkedIn","AI Notes","1 -"]],["MIT/Conference/IIA/25/04/15/","source-block-36406","One example is our Avalon facility, where we’ve deployed infrastructure with an active customer already onboard.",["Person/Chase Lochmiller Chase Lochmiller | LinkedIn","AI Notes","1 -"]],["MIT/Conference/IIA/25/04/15/","source-block-36530","2 -",["CrusoeAI CrusoeAI","Person/Chase Lochmiller Chase Lochmiller | LinkedIn","AI Notes"]],["MIT/Conference/IIA/25/04/15/","source-block-36567","Here’s a continuation of the transcript from Person/Chase Lochmiller during the Crusoe CEO conversation, focusing on energy-first AI infrastructure and optimism vs. doom loops:",["Person/Chase Lochmiller Chase Lochmiller | LinkedIn","AI Notes","2 -"]],["MIT/Conference/IIA/25/04/15/","source-block-36794","Transcript: Chase Lochmiller on Optimism, Clean Energy, and Crusoe’s Strategy",["Person/Chase Lochmiller Chase Lochmiller | LinkedIn","AI Notes","2 -"]],["MIT/Conference/IIA/25/04/15/","source-block-37903","On Location Strategy",["Person/Chase Lochmiller Chase Lochmiller | LinkedIn","AI Notes","2 -"]],["MIT/Conference/IIA/25/04/15/","source-block-38002","Wind is blowing",["Person/Chase Lochmiller Chase Lochmiller | LinkedIn","AI Notes","2 -"]],["MIT/Conference/IIA/25/04/15/","source-block-38031","Sun is shining",["Person/Chase Lochmiller Chase Lochmiller | LinkedIn","AI Notes","2 -"]],["MIT/Conference/IIA/25/04/15/","source-block-38085","Geothermal energy is available",["Person/Chase Lochmiller Chase Lochmiller | LinkedIn","AI Notes","2 -"]],["MIT/Conference/IIA/25/04/15/","source-block-38161","We’ve built quite a bit in Iceland — clean geothermal energy.",["Person/Chase Lochmiller Chase Lochmiller | LinkedIn","AI Notes","2 -"]],["MIT/Conference/IIA/25/04/15/","source-block-38240","West Texas (e.g., Abilene, TX) is arguably the best market in the U.S. for wind and solar. That’s why we chose to build there.",["Person/Chase Lochmiller Chase Lochmiller | LinkedIn","AI Notes","2 -"]],["MIT/Conference/IIA/25/04/15/","source-block-38521","3 -",["CrusoeAI CrusoeAI","Person/Chase Lochmiller Chase Lochmiller | LinkedIn","AI Notes"]]],"format_version":5}